<article data-job-detail class="mx-auto max-w-7xl space-y-6" hidden>
  <a href="/postulante/ofertas" class="q-link inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m10 19-7-7 7-7M3 12h18"/></svg>Volver a las oportunidades</a>

  <header class="q-card space-y-4 p-5 sm:p-8">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span data-detail-area class="q-job-badge" data-status="DRAFT"></span><span class="q-job-badge" data-status="PUBLISHED">Oferta publicada</span></div>
    <h2 data-detail-title class="break-words text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-3xl"></h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 21s7-5.5 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 5.5 7 11 7 11ZM12 12a2 2 0 1 0 0-4 2 2 0 0 0 0 4Z"/></svg><span data-detail-location></span></span>
      <span data-detail-modality-wrap class="inline-flex items-center gap-2" hidden><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m3 10 9-7 9 7M5 9v11h14V9M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg><span data-detail-modality></span></span>
      <span data-detail-schedule-wrap class="inline-flex items-center gap-2" hidden><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg><span data-detail-schedule></span></span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 3 8 21m8-18-2 18M4 9h16M3 15h16"/></svg><span data-detail-code></span></span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 5h14v15H5V5Zm3-2v4m8-4v4M5 10h14"/></svg><span class="sr-only">Publicado: </span><span data-detail-date></span></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(16rem,1fr)]">
    <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5">
      <section class="q-card p-5 sm:p-7" aria-labelledby="detail-description-title">
        <h3 id="detail-description-title" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 3h9l3 3v15H6V3Zm3 7h6m-6 4h6m-6 4h4"/></svg>Sobre el puesto</h3>
        <p data-detail-description class="mt-4 max-w-prose whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"></p>
      </section>
      <section data-responsibilities-section class="q-card p-5 sm:p-7" hidden><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m4 7 2 2 3-3m2 2h9M4 15l2 2 3-3m2 2h9"/></svg>Funciones principales</h3><ul data-detail-responsibilities class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"></ul></section>
      <section class="q-card p-5 sm:p-7" aria-labelledby="detail-requirements-title">
        <h3 id="detail-requirements-title" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m4 7 2 2 3-3m2 2h9M4 15l2 2 3-3m2 2h9"/></svg>Lo que buscamos</h3>
        <ul data-detail-requirements class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="q-card p-5 sm:p-7" aria-labelledby="detail-profile-title">
        <h3 id="detail-profile-title" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8ZM5 20a7 7 0 0 1 14 0H5Z"/></svg>Experiencia y formación</h3>
        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Experiencia</h4><p data-detail-experience class="mt-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"></p></div><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Formación</h4><p data-detail-education class="mt-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200"></p></div></div>
      </section>
      <section data-benefits-section class="q-card p-5 sm:p-7" hidden><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 10h16v11H4V10Zm-1-4h18v4H3V6Zm9 0v15M12 6C9 6 7 5 7 3c0-1 1-2 2-2 2 0 3 3 3 5Zm0 0c3 0 5-1 5-3 0-1-1-2-2-2-2 0-3 3-3 5Z"/></svg>Lo que ofrecemos</h3><ul data-detail-benefits class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"></ul></section>
    </div>
    <aside class="q-card self-start p-5 sm:p-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24" aria-labelledby="detail-apply-title">
      <h3 id="detail-apply-title" class="text-xl font-semibold">Conoce la oportunidad</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Revisa la descripción y los requisitos para identificar si el puesto se ajusta a tu perfil.</p>
      <a data-apply href="/postulante/postular" class="q-primary mt-5 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2">Postularme ahora<svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="m4 4 17 8-17 8 2-8-2-8Zm2 8h15"/></svg></a>
      <dl class="mt-5 space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 dark:border-slate-700">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Modalidad</dt><dd data-summary-modality class="text-right font-medium"></dd></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Código de ref.</dt><dd data-summary-code class="text-right font-medium"></dd></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><dt class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Área</dt><dd data-summary-area class="break-words text-right font-medium"></dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-5 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">Podrás revisar tus datos antes de confirmar tu postulación.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</article>
